    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p>Public SaaS companies like Salesforce, Adobe, and Atlassian consistently report gross margins above 75%. If your gross margin falls significantly below this range, investigate whether infrastructure costs, support overhead, or payment processing fees are driving the gap.</p>

